# Compiled binaries and executables
*.out
*.exe
*.app
a.out

# All files without extension (common for C++ executables on Linux/Mac)
*
!*.*
!*/
!Makefile
!makefile

# Object files
*.o
*.obj

# VS Code settings
.vscode/

# OS files
*.DS_Store

# Optional: Test images generated by your programs
*.jpg
*.png
*.jpeg
```

## The key part explained:
```
*        # Ignore all files
!*.*     # But don't ignore files with extensions
!*/      # Don't ignore directories
!Makefile # Don't ignore Makefiles (no extension but needed)
